## Returns the MD5 digest of `data` as 32 lowercase hex characters.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `data`: the bytes to digest. Borrowed.
##
## ## Retorno
## An owned hex string; release it with `banish`. MD5 is broken for signatures:
## see the module design notes.
weave md5 with data as string into string:
    return calling pengu_c_seal_md5 with data

## Returns the SHA-1 digest of `data` as 40 lowercase hex characters.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `data`: the bytes to digest. Borrowed.
##
## ## Retorno
