##
## ## Parámetros
## - `data`: the bytes to digest. Borrowed.
##
## ## Retorno
## An owned hex string; release it with `banish`.
weave sha3_224 with data as string into string:
    return calling _hash_hex with ALG_SHA3_224 , data

## Returns the SHA3-256 digest of `data` as 64 lowercase hex characters.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `data`: the bytes to digest. Borrowed.
