weave sha3_256 with data as string into string:
    return calling _hash_hex with ALG_SHA3_256 , data

## Returns the SHA3-384 digest of `data` as 96 lowercase hex characters.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `data`: the bytes to digest. Borrowed.
