## - `key`: the secret key. Borrowed.
## - `message`: the bytes to authenticate. Borrowed.
##
## ## Retorno
## An owned hex string; release it with `banish`.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## calling seal.hmac_sha256 with "key", "msg"
## ```
weave hmac_sha256 with key as string , message as string into string:
    return calling _hmac_hex with ALG_SHA256 , key , message

